    <item>
      <title>Passei no Exame - EX316 Red Hat Certified Specialist in OpenShift Virtualization</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>eurodrigolira@gmail.com (Rodrigo Lira)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/images/openshift-virtualization.png&#34; &gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;300&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;258&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/images/openshift-virtualization-300x258.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/images/openshift-virtualization-300x258.png 800w, http://localhost:1313/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/images/openshift-virtualization-300x258.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/images/openshift-virtualization-300x258.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Salve Salve Pessoal!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Hoje fiz o exame &lt;strong&gt;EX316 Red Hat Certified Specialist in OpenShift Virtualization&lt;/strong&gt;, e consegui passar.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/images/openshift-virtualization-score.png&#34; &gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;1024&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;453&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/images/openshift-virtualization-score-1024x453_hu_78d533f79f1bbaee.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/images/openshift-virtualization-score-1024x453_hu_78d533f79f1bbaee.png 800w, http://localhost:1313/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/images/openshift-virtualization-score-1024x453.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/images/openshift-virtualization-score-1024x453.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;Tive a oportunidade de fazer o curso oficial para este exame, o mesmo estava em promoção junto com o exame, então acabei pagando apenas 30% do valor.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
